WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:03.857
&gt;&gt; DO YOU HAVE A DATE?

00:00:03.892 --> 00:00:05.187
&gt;&gt; Vice President Harris: I

00:00:05.188 --> 00:00:07.199
WILL KEEP YOU POSTED.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.654
&gt;&gt; Gillian: IT HAS BEEN 79

00:00:09.655 --> 00:00:10.847
DAYS SINCE PRESIDENT BIDEN IS

00:00:10.849 --> 00:00:16.072
TASKED HER TO SPEARHEAD EFFORTS

00:00:16.074 --> 00:00:18.815
TO TACKLE THE CRISIS THERE.

00:00:18.817 --> 00:00:20.119
THE ATTORNEY GENERAL OF ARIZONA

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:23.087
ALSO RUNNING FOR SENATE IN 2022.

00:00:23.088 --> 00:00:24.471
THANK YOU FOR JOINING US.

00:00:24.472 --> 00:00:25.950
INTERESTINGLY, YOU ARE CALLING

00:00:25.985 --> 00:00:28.337
ON PRESIDENT BIDEN NOW TO THROW

00:00:28.371 --> 00:00:29.714
IN THE TOWEL, PACKED UP HIS

00:00:29.716 --> 00:00:30.539
BAGS.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.781
HE IS IN EUROPE AND GIVE UP THE

00:00:33.815 --> 00:00:36.643
REST OF THE G7 TO COME HOME HERE

00:00:36.644 --> 00:00:37.924
TO THE U.S. TO ADDRESS THE

00:00:37.926 --> 00:00:38.290
BORDER CRISIS.

00:00:38.291 --> 00:00:41.303
WHAT EXACTLY DO YOU THINK IS

00:00:41.304 --> 00:00:43.934
GOING TO COME OF YOUR REQUEST?

00:00:43.969 --> 00:00:46.483
&gt;&gt; THUS FAR, THE BIDEN

00:00:46.484 --> 00:00:47.315
ADMINISTRATION ESSENTIALLY TOLD

00:00:47.316 --> 00:00:48.392
STATES LIKE ARIZONA AND TEXAS TO

00:00:48.426 --> 00:00:48.871
BALANCE.

00:00:48.906 --> 00:00:51.728
THERE IS A CRISIS AT OUR BORDER.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:53.167
WE WERE JUST TALKING ABOUT OUR

00:00:53.201 --> 00:00:54.156
NUMBERS.

00:00:54.157 --> 00:00:56.782
IT HAS BEEN 79 DAYS SINCE

00:00:56.783 --> 00:00:57.887
VICE PRESIDENT HARRIS WAS

00:00:57.888 --> 00:00:58.280
APPOINTED.

00:00:58.314 --> 00:01:01.093
YOU HAVE SEEN HIM AS 500,000

00:01:01.128 --> 00:01:01.652
PEOPLE.

00:01:01.654 --> 00:01:03.586
THAT IS THE ENTIRE POPULATION OF

00:01:03.587 --> 00:01:04.683
MINNEAPOLIS OR KANSAS CITY

00:01:04.717 --> 00:01:05.396
COMING ACROSS.

00:01:05.397 --> 00:01:07.635
YOU TALK ABOUT THE IMPACT THAT

00:01:07.637 --> 00:01:10.916
HAS ON THE ENVIRONMENT AND

00:01:10.917 --> 00:01:11.861
HARDWORKING TAXPAYERS.

00:01:11.895 --> 00:01:12.835
BIDEN ADMINISTRATION IS SPENDING

00:01:12.836 --> 00:01:13.800
TENS OF MILLIONS OF DOLLARS TO

00:01:13.801 --> 00:01:15.021
HIS HOUSE PEOPLE.

00:01:15.022 --> 00:01:16.455
THEY ARE TRYING TO GET THE

00:01:16.489 --> 00:01:16.824
BENEFITS.

00:01:16.825 --> 00:01:18.927
THAT AFFECTS TAXPAYERS.

00:01:18.928 --> 00:01:21.449
I KNOW AS A PROSECUTOR THAT THE

00:01:21.483 --> 00:01:22.816
CARTELS ARE EXPLOITING NOT ONLY

00:01:22.818 --> 00:01:23.676
THE PEOPLE.

00:01:23.678 --> 00:01:25.803
THEY ARE EXPLOITING THIS CRISIS

00:01:25.804 --> 00:01:26.758
TO DRAMATICALLY INCREASE THE

00:01:26.759 --> 00:01:28.914
AMOUNT OF FENTANYL AND HEROIN

00:01:28.948 --> 00:01:30.483
COMING INTO OUR COUNTRY.

00:01:30.517 --> 00:01:32.741
THAT IS GOING TO AFFECT EVERYONE

00:01:32.775 --> 00:01:33.754
IN THE ENTIRE COUNTRY.

00:01:33.789 --> 00:01:35.642
THIS IS A CRISIS.

00:01:35.643 --> 00:01:38.850
IT IS TO BECOME A GOOD STRATEGY.

00:01:38.852 --> 00:01:39.930
THE BIDEN ADMINISTRATION HAS

00:01:39.932 --> 00:01:41.016
DONE NOTHING.

00:01:41.018 --> 00:01:43.533
THEY’RE GOING TO EUROPE.

00:01:43.534 --> 00:01:45.033
PLEASE CARE ABOUT AMERICA AT

00:01:45.067 --> 00:01:46.485
LEAST HALF AS MUCH AS YOU CARE

00:01:46.486 --> 00:01:49.229
ABOUT EUROPE, AND YOU WILL BE

00:01:49.264 --> 00:01:50.565
ABLE TO SOLVE THIS.

00:01:50.566 --> 00:01:52.637
&gt;&gt; Gillian: AND IT APPEARS

00:01:52.639 --> 00:01:54.273
THAT THIS IS FAST BECOMING A

00:01:54.274 --> 00:01:55.334
STORY ABOUT CONFLICTING

00:01:55.368 --> 00:01:55.975
MESSAGES.

00:01:55.976 --> 00:02:01.119
ON THE ONE HAND, WE HAVE THE

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:03.312
VICE PRESIDENT SAYING THAT TOO

00:02:03.313 --> 00:02:04.566
WOULD BE MIGRANTS DON’T COME

00:02:04.568 --> 00:02:06.338
HERE.

00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:07.935
DON’T COME HERE.

00:02:07.936 --> 00:02:12.127
BUT THE REALITY THAT WE GET FROM

00:02:12.161 --> 00:02:13.598
OFFICIALS LIKE YOURSELF SAYING

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:16.026
THAT IS NOT WITH THE GOVERNMENT

00:02:16.061 --> 00:02:18.159
IS REALLY DOING BEHIND THE

00:02:18.193 --> 00:02:18.892
SCENES.

00:02:18.894 --> 00:02:24.263
CBP AND DHS ARE WORKING 24 HOURS

00:02:24.264 --> 00:02:27.170
AWAYA DAY AND SEVEN DAYS A WEEK

00:02:27.171 --> 00:02:29.604
TRY TO PROCESS HIS CONSTANT FLOW

00:02:29.605 --> 00:02:30.889
OF MIGRANTS THAT ARE COMING

00:02:30.923 --> 00:02:31.738
WITHOUT DOCUMENTATION.

00:02:31.772 --> 00:02:33.057
WHO DO WE BELIEVE?

00:02:33.058 --> 00:02:34.715
WE SEE THESE PICTURES FROM THE

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:35.011
GROUND.

00:02:35.013 --> 00:02:36.587
THEY LOOK HORRIFIC.

00:02:36.621 --> 00:02:38.725
DO WE NOT BELIEVE OUR OWN EYES?

00:02:38.726 --> 00:02:41.406
&gt;&gt; WHAT IS THE OLD LINE?

00:02:41.441 --> 00:02:43.189
WHO DO YOU WANT TO BELIEVE.

00:02:43.223 --> 00:02:44.170
THE PRESIDENT OR YOUR LYING

00:02:44.171 --> 00:02:44.584
EYES?

00:02:44.586 --> 00:02:47.070
NOT ONLY DID THE STATS NOT LIE,

00:02:47.072 --> 00:02:48.824
BUT THE PICTURES WE ARE SEEING

00:02:48.858 --> 00:02:49.447
DO NOT LIE.

00:02:49.448 --> 00:02:51.020
THE STATISTICS THAT WE HAVE SEEN

00:02:51.054 --> 00:02:52.585
IN THE SEIZURES AND THE PEOPLE

00:02:52.586 --> 00:02:53.709
COMING OVER.

00:02:53.742 --> 00:02:54.860
THOSE ARE FACTS.

00:02:54.894 --> 00:02:56.412
PEOPLE ARE ENTITLED TO THEIR OWN

00:02:56.413 --> 00:02:58.016
OPINION, BUT NOT THEIR OWN

00:02:58.050 --> 00:02:58.490
FACTS.

00:02:58.524 --> 00:03:00.507
I HAVE A MESSAGE FOR THE BIDEN

00:03:00.508 --> 00:03:00.768
ADMINISTRATION.

00:03:00.769 --> 00:03:01.977
YOU WANT TO KNOW THE ROOT CAUSE

00:03:01.978 --> 00:03:02.940
OF IMMIGRATION?

00:03:02.942 --> 00:03:04.694
THIS IS THE GREATEST COUNTRY IN

00:03:04.695 --> 00:03:05.743
THE WORLD.

00:03:05.744 --> 00:03:07.395
INSTEAD OF SPENDING HUNDREDS OF

00:03:07.396 --> 00:03:08.447
MILLIONS OF DOLLARS IN

00:03:08.482 --> 00:03:10.016
CENTRAL AMERICA, SPEND THAT

00:03:10.017 --> 00:03:11.474
MONEY ON SECURING OUR BORDER AND

00:03:11.508 --> 00:03:12.571
GETTING RESOURCES TO BORDER

00:03:12.606 --> 00:03:15.266
PATROL AND ICE SO THEY CAN

00:03:15.300 --> 00:03:17.166
CONTINUE TO PROCESS THE

00:03:17.167 --> 00:03:18.233
1.2 MILLION PEOPLE WITH

00:03:18.234 --> 00:03:19.868
DEPORTATION ORDERS THAT THE

00:03:19.903 --> 00:03:22.190
BIDEN ADMINISTRATION IS REFUSING

00:03:22.225 --> 00:03:24.024
TO DEPORT.

00:03:24.025 --> 00:03:26.887
WE HAVE A CASE PENDING A FEDERAL

00:03:26.888 --> 00:03:28.108
JUDGE DECISION ASKING THE BIDEN

00:03:28.142 --> 00:03:29.207
ADMINISTRATION TO FOLLOW THE

00:03:29.241 --> 00:03:29.466
LAW.

00:03:29.499 --> 00:03:31.058
COMPLETE THE LAW AND DEPORT

00:03:31.059 --> 00:03:33.536
PEOPLE WHO HAVE BEEN ORDERED TO

